WEBVTT

00:05.213 --> 00:06.297
Episode 8
Shout Out Loud, Cadets!

00:06.381 --> 00:10.260
All right, we passed!
We're official Rangers now!

00:11.428 --> 00:13.972
Thanks to you guys, we managed
to gather the keys efficiently.

00:14.055 --> 00:16.975
Seriously, I can't believe
you were so careless with the key.

00:17.058 --> 00:18.143
Right, Kurusu?

00:19.811 --> 00:23.815
I heard about your reason
for joining the Rangers.

00:23.898 --> 00:26.234
You wanted to be popular
with the ladies, right?

00:27.068 --> 00:29.070
What a vain coward.

00:29.154 --> 00:32.490
Instead of joining the Rangers,
why don't you become a host?

00:34.826 --> 00:36.244
Hold up, Ranmaru.

00:36.828 --> 00:39.664
I can't believe
you fought against a Junior First Rank.

00:39.748 --> 00:41.166
I've got to admit, I was surprised.

00:41.249 --> 00:42.250
Huh?

00:43.835 --> 00:46.755
47, 48, 49…

00:46.838 --> 00:48.757
-50, 51…
-Where are you looking?

00:48.840 --> 00:55.764
52, 53, 54, 55, 56, 57, 58…

00:55.847 --> 00:57.766
59, 60.

00:57.849 --> 01:00.268
My, my! Congratulations!

01:00.351 --> 01:02.312
It's our complete loss.

01:02.395 --> 01:04.773
Now you just need
to pass through the gate!

01:04.856 --> 01:08.693
I'm looking forward to
everyone's endeavors as official Rangers!

01:08.777 --> 01:10.028
No need to put up a front.

01:10.111 --> 01:12.280
Putting up a front?
Of course not!

01:12.363 --> 01:15.033
-Yay! I got the Yellow key!
-Huh? Wait!

01:15.116 --> 01:16.868
-Yay!
-What?

01:16.951 --> 01:21.206
Hey! Are you guys stupid?
There's no way you're allowed to do that!

01:21.289 --> 01:22.290
What's wrong?

01:23.374 --> 01:26.377
Those guys snatched our key
after the exam ended.

01:26.461 --> 01:27.796
Isn't that cheating?

01:27.879 --> 01:31.591
What? The second day isn't over yet.

01:31.674 --> 01:34.010
That's impossible!
Didn't the bell ring?

01:34.094 --> 01:35.929
It didn't. We didn't hear it.

01:38.098 --> 01:39.933
-Oops…
-They found out.

01:44.771 --> 01:46.439
Go! Go! Loser Ranger!

03:11.900 --> 03:13.943
Hurry up and get it back!

03:16.571 --> 03:19.782
You want me to tamper with this?
What's up all of a sudden?

03:19.866 --> 03:23.161
I want you to modify it and make it
ring earlier than the supposed time.

03:23.244 --> 03:24.787
You're good at things like this, right?

03:24.871 --> 03:26.831
Well, I guess it's pretty easy for me…

03:26.915 --> 03:27.916
Don't tell me…

03:27.999 --> 03:29.000
I get it!

03:29.083 --> 03:31.920
When Junior First Rank Suzukiri
lets her guard down after the bell rings,

03:32.003 --> 03:33.087
we'll snatch her key openly!

03:33.171 --> 03:34.172
That's right.

03:34.255 --> 03:36.174
There's no way it'll work as planned!

03:36.257 --> 03:38.676
In that case, I can be the timekeeper.

03:38.760 --> 03:41.179
I'll give the signal
as close to the time as possible.

03:41.262 --> 03:43.973
It'll be laughable if our gamble pays off.

03:44.057 --> 03:45.642
You guys too?

03:45.725 --> 03:49.896
Let's protect the key until time's up
and show those guys what we're made of.

03:52.649 --> 03:54.359
Hurry up and get it back!

03:55.276 --> 03:57.111
Run, Sakurama and Kurusu!

04:01.574 --> 04:03.159
Tsk, he's fast!

04:03.243 --> 04:04.244
-Hibiki!
-What?

04:04.327 --> 04:07.747
Please, give it to me!
I swear I'll protect it!

04:07.830 --> 04:10.375
Please protect it
even if it costs your life!

04:12.585 --> 04:13.711
Everyone, get him!

04:17.423 --> 04:18.424
Screw you!

04:18.508 --> 04:20.260
Everyone! Protect Yamato!

04:22.262 --> 04:23.680
Don't get in my way!

04:23.763 --> 04:26.933
What a coincidence.
I was about to say the same thing to you!

04:32.355 --> 04:33.773
We can't let him get away!

04:34.524 --> 04:35.525
Crap.

04:55.461 --> 04:59.048
<i>Time's up! Please conclude
your fights and head back immediately.</i>

04:59.549 --> 05:03.845
Man, you've got to be kidding me!
I can't believe it.

05:03.928 --> 05:06.180
Those guys sure pulled a lame stunt.

05:07.515 --> 05:08.850
You heard him.

05:14.981 --> 05:16.649
Take a good look at him.

05:17.233 --> 05:18.276
Isn't he cool?

05:18.860 --> 05:20.361
Prepare yourselves.

05:20.445 --> 05:23.281
The remaining four keys
will be ours tomorrow.

05:25.241 --> 05:26.868
Wh-Who's there?

05:35.626 --> 05:36.711
Junior First Rank Aizome!

05:36.794 --> 05:39.839
Run. Run now! Hurry up!

05:39.922 --> 05:41.924
How could I leave you here and run--

05:46.721 --> 05:48.598
You should have run away.

05:48.681 --> 05:52.018
Then you wouldn't need
to suffer this pain.

05:52.769 --> 05:55.104
Why is a boss monster like you here?

05:55.188 --> 05:56.439
Junior First Rank.

05:56.522 --> 05:59.942
Are you the great evil
creating conflict in this place?

06:00.026 --> 06:01.110
So what if I am?

06:01.819 --> 06:04.113
-Don't you find it hard to live?
-What?

06:04.197 --> 06:06.616
Your position doesn't fit your stature.

06:06.699 --> 06:09.619
You are not as young as you appear to be.

06:09.702 --> 06:12.205
You've been living
a life of constant immense pressure

06:12.288 --> 06:14.707
in a position of responsibility.

06:14.791 --> 06:17.377
I can see that from your skin texture.

06:17.960 --> 06:21.297
Instead of letting you
continue to live and deteriorate,

06:21.381 --> 06:24.175
I shall preserve
your current appearance forever.

06:24.884 --> 06:27.387
Now, bow to me.

06:27.470 --> 06:28.471
The hell?

06:28.554 --> 06:30.765
Thanks for your concern,
but that's none of your business!

06:30.848 --> 06:33.226
I'm still going to look cute
when I become an old granny,

06:33.309 --> 06:34.394
so don't worry about me!

06:34.477 --> 06:37.438
Divine Artifact, Manifest! Umibozu!

06:46.489 --> 06:47.990
How foolish.

06:52.495 --> 06:54.914
That was a really risky fight.

06:54.997 --> 06:56.666
I had only heard rumors
about your ability,

06:56.749 --> 06:58.501
but I'm glad I decided to trust it.

06:59.252 --> 07:02.588
That was nothing.
It's just a simple device, anyway.

07:02.672 --> 07:05.466
Still, that was something
I couldn't have done.

07:05.550 --> 07:07.552
Since you're this dexterous,

07:07.635 --> 07:09.887
wouldn't the Yellow Squadron
be more suitable for you

07:09.971 --> 07:11.889
instead of the Blue Squadron?

07:11.973 --> 07:14.308
In return,
give me your spot in the Blue Squadron.

07:14.392 --> 07:16.894
I'd probably stand out more there
than being the Yellow Keeper.

07:16.978 --> 07:18.896
I'll be satisfied
with being the Green Keeper!

07:19.564 --> 07:21.858
You guys are getting ahead of yourselves.

07:21.941 --> 07:24.902
Us as Dragon Keepers…
Doesn't that sound good?

07:28.114 --> 07:30.533
Speaking of "us",
where's Shippou?

07:30.616 --> 07:32.869
He didn't appear
during the second day at all, did he?

07:32.952 --> 07:37.957
Don't tell me he was so into his workout
that he forgot the time… No way, right?

07:38.040 --> 07:41.294
That's possible!
In that case, he'd be there. Let's go!

07:41.377 --> 07:43.921
Well… There's something
I need to do, so…

07:44.005 --> 07:45.756
Okay, we'll go ahead first then.

07:51.053 --> 07:52.054
Sakurama…

07:52.138 --> 07:54.891
Wait. You're not Sakurama, right?

07:55.475 --> 07:58.227
Why is a fighter like you here?

07:58.311 --> 08:01.063
There's no way
I'd reveal the reason to my enemy.

08:01.147 --> 08:03.566
Enemy? Aren't we comrades now?

08:05.151 --> 08:08.154
Shut up.
Don't you dare tell anyone about me.

08:08.237 --> 08:09.697
You have a death wish?

08:09.780 --> 08:10.823
Then let me ask you this.

08:10.907 --> 08:14.327
Are you really a bad guy
that's capable of killing me?

08:17.371 --> 08:20.041
Finish up what you need to do quickly
and join us.

08:24.921 --> 08:29.425
This is bad! Shippou…
Shippou's no longer himself!

08:30.593 --> 08:32.428
Is this the Shippou we know?

08:33.429 --> 08:35.848
My strength is that of an ant.

08:35.932 --> 08:39.477
<i>No matter how many ants may gather,
they are no match for a dragon.</i>

08:43.147 --> 08:45.483
Even so, we can win.
We will win.

08:45.566 --> 08:48.402
I'm a failure, but not these guys.

08:48.486 --> 08:50.988
Usukubo pushed through
the pain of her injury

08:51.072 --> 08:53.407
and fought against
a dreaded Junior First Rank.

08:53.491 --> 08:55.910
Kurusu is unrivaled
when it comes to escaping.

08:55.993 --> 08:58.412
We were able to get a key because of him.

08:58.496 --> 09:01.582
A key? You guys managed to get one?

09:01.666 --> 09:04.335
Yeah. But we couldn't have
achieved this by ourselves.

09:04.919 --> 09:08.923
That guy… Everything would've been over
without Sakurama.

09:09.006 --> 09:12.134
No matter what kind of guy he is,
I will help him.

09:12.218 --> 09:14.136
You should join us too, Shippou!

09:14.804 --> 09:16.013
Koguma…

09:16.097 --> 09:19.517
That's right! With your power,
we have nothing to fear!

09:20.351 --> 09:22.687
Come on,
here's your favorite bench press!

09:22.770 --> 09:26.107
Wow, look at those biceps!
They look like Mount Everest!

09:26.190 --> 09:31.112
Thanks, but no more.
I will never reach that man.

09:31.195 --> 09:33.823
<i>His body is truly the realm of art.</i>

09:33.906 --> 09:37.994
<i>Junior First Rank Nadeshiko…
I cannot fight against him.</i>

09:38.077 --> 09:40.621
Oh, you don't need to fight him anymore.

09:40.705 --> 09:42.039
Huh? What about the key?

09:42.123 --> 09:44.000
The elite team has it, apparently.

09:44.083 --> 09:45.918
What did you say?

09:47.461 --> 09:50.881
You should've told me that earlier!

09:52.967 --> 09:55.386
Now there are no opponents in my way!

09:55.469 --> 09:57.138
I am unrivaled!

09:57.221 --> 10:00.391
With these muscles of mine,
I shall scatter the rabbles!

10:02.602 --> 10:03.644
He's a moron.

10:04.312 --> 10:05.563
I'm sorry.

10:05.646 --> 10:06.647
For what?

10:06.731 --> 10:08.649
The key. I couldn't protect it.

10:08.733 --> 10:10.568
-Any exceptional human being…
-<i>It's Ishikawa.</i>

10:10.651 --> 10:11.652
…makes mistakes.

10:12.862 --> 10:17.408
Yukino. I'm sure that you'll be able
to learn from your mistake.

10:18.993 --> 10:20.828
Yes, I'll try.

10:27.001 --> 10:28.669
<i>This is dumb.</i>

10:28.753 --> 10:32.298
<i>Why are those surface-dwellers
all over one another at a time like this?</i>

10:33.007 --> 10:35.426
Got it.
I'll let Sakurama know too.

10:35.509 --> 10:37.511
Thanks. Kurusu,

10:37.595 --> 10:39.805
-did you mean what you said earlier?
-Hmm?

10:39.889 --> 10:42.892
About me being suitable
for the Yellow Squadron.

10:42.975 --> 10:45.186
Anyone would agree
if they saw what you did.

10:45.269 --> 10:46.312
Right.

10:46.395 --> 10:49.398
But it's fine if you insist
on joining the Blue Squadron.

10:53.277 --> 10:54.904
I'll go pay a visit to the instructor.

10:56.280 --> 10:59.825
Oh, right! I was supposed to
meet someone too!

10:59.909 --> 11:01.160
Oh, it's not my girlfriend, so--

11:01.243 --> 11:02.870
I don't care even if it's your girlfriend.

11:08.668 --> 11:11.671
Hey. I just told Usukubo
something important,

11:11.754 --> 11:12.922
so you should hear it too.

11:13.005 --> 11:14.090
Something important?

11:14.173 --> 11:16.342
Since we're on the same team and all.

11:16.425 --> 11:17.426
Hmm.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.844
-I'm grateful to you.
-What?

11:18.928 --> 11:20.471
No matter who you are,

11:20.596 --> 11:23.099
you made me realize
the role I should play.

11:24.684 --> 11:25.768
Thanks.

11:28.229 --> 11:31.691
<i>What a joke.
I'm just using you guys, that's all.</i>

11:33.693 --> 11:35.111
<i>Yamato?</i>

11:36.195 --> 11:37.780
<i>I've finally made up my mind.</i>

11:38.572 --> 11:40.241
<i>He was a hero to me.</i>

11:41.075 --> 11:44.245
<i>But now, I'll become a hero myself!</i>

11:56.090 --> 11:58.175
That guy…

12:04.056 --> 12:06.726
<i>What was that?
Why was that Junior First Rank…</i>

12:06.809 --> 12:09.979
<i>Someone! Anyone! Save her!</i>

12:10.563 --> 12:15.359
My dear lost sheep…
I shall save you one by one.

12:19.071 --> 12:21.282
I'll start with you.

12:22.575 --> 12:24.827
Stop right there!

12:31.917 --> 12:35.296
Wh-Why did you come back? Just leave--

12:44.597 --> 12:47.683
I'm a Ranger too!

12:47.767 --> 12:50.686
<i>Just like those heroes
who gave me hope…</i>

12:50.770 --> 12:53.189
<i>I joined the Rangers</i>

12:53.272 --> 12:55.816
<i>to stand by the weak!</i>

13:00.780 --> 13:01.822
Lord Peltrola!

13:01.906 --> 13:04.742
I'm surprised that
a mere soldier that's not a Dragon Keeper

13:04.825 --> 13:07.411
managed to hurt me this badly.

13:07.995 --> 13:11.248
I shall search for an empty place
to focus on my recovery.

13:12.082 --> 13:15.044
As for the cleanup…
I'm counting on you, XX.

13:15.127 --> 13:16.128
As you wish.

13:20.883 --> 13:22.051
What a fool.

13:23.928 --> 13:25.763
Are you really sure about this?

13:25.846 --> 13:29.600
You'll let me take Yukino's place
in exchange for this?

13:29.683 --> 13:31.894
<i>Are these guys for real?</i>

13:32.478 --> 13:33.729
<i>This is bad.</i>

13:34.230 --> 13:36.148
You have the talent.

13:36.232 --> 13:41.654
In the first place, I've always preferred
having you over Yukino as our teammate.

13:41.737 --> 13:45.574
<i>Ishikawa… You're a way worse scumbag
than I am.</i>

13:45.658 --> 13:47.159
<i>Surface-dwellers are scary.</i>

13:47.243 --> 13:50.162
Kurusu, welcome to our team.

13:52.581 --> 13:55.668
I'm sorry,
but this doesn't belong to only me.

13:55.751 --> 13:57.461
-What?
-<i>What?</i>

13:57.545 --> 14:00.631
The four of us
worked together to get this,

14:00.714 --> 14:02.591
so I cannot give it to you
at my discretion.

14:02.675 --> 14:04.468
You know that you can become
an official Ranger

14:04.552 --> 14:05.845
if you agree to this, right?

14:05.928 --> 14:07.847
It's all the same if we win tomorrow.

14:07.930 --> 14:10.683
Well said, Yamato.

14:13.185 --> 14:16.605
Ishikawa, I could say
that you're really awesome in a way!

14:16.689 --> 14:20.025
You're so good at this,
I feel like taking you down a peg or two.

14:20.609 --> 14:22.444
With my pride on the line,
that is.

14:22.528 --> 14:23.529
Wha…

14:24.029 --> 14:25.948
Please excuse me.

14:27.116 --> 14:30.411
<i>This guy's also a moron.
He blew his chance!</i>

14:30.494 --> 14:35.040
<i>No, this is exactly why
he's perfect for my team.</i>

14:37.626 --> 14:40.045
Do these belong to Aizome?

14:40.129 --> 14:43.549
I've also confirmed
several bloodstains on the other side.

14:43.632 --> 14:45.509
What of the emergency signal to HQ?

14:45.593 --> 14:47.052
They should've received it.

14:47.136 --> 14:49.555
If transmissions are still working,
that is.

14:49.638 --> 14:53.559
Seems like our guest doesn't want
the top brass to know about this.

14:53.642 --> 14:58.147
Huh, so what now?
This isn't the time to be having an exam.

14:58.230 --> 15:00.566
No, we won't inform the cadets about this.

15:00.649 --> 15:03.569
This is top-secret information
among the Rangers.

15:03.652 --> 15:06.906
It's a job
for the real Rangers from here on.

15:06.989 --> 15:09.116
Bring along
your Replica Divine Artifacts, guys.

15:09.950 --> 15:11.994
We're not putting up a performance here.

15:12.077 --> 15:13.746
It's a hunt.

15:15.080 --> 15:19.418
Time to smoke out the boss monster!

15:21.587 --> 15:24.506
There's nothing to fear
now that I'm on board.

15:24.590 --> 15:26.425
Just relax and count on me!

15:26.508 --> 15:28.302
I have the strength of 100 men!

15:28.385 --> 15:30.346
Even if we're against 5 people,
it's 5 against 105!

15:30.429 --> 15:31.680
An overwhelming victory for us!

15:31.764 --> 15:33.432
-It's 104, you mean.
-Oh, you're right!

15:33.515 --> 15:34.892
Glad to see you're doing well.

15:34.975 --> 15:35.976
Thank you!

15:36.060 --> 15:37.978
Koguma's the last one.

15:38.062 --> 15:39.772
Sorry that I'm late.

15:46.445 --> 15:48.072
It's time. Let's go.

15:49.907 --> 15:51.992
The keys are split four to one.

15:52.076 --> 15:54.078
Let's keep it simple
and have an all-out fight.

15:54.161 --> 15:56.372
The team that gets all five keys wins.

15:56.872 --> 15:58.290
You're fine with that, right?

15:58.374 --> 16:00.542
It'll be one-on-one fights,
fair and square!

16:00.626 --> 16:02.878
The only weapon allowed
is our Dragon Gadget.

16:02.962 --> 16:04.797
You guys better not cheat!

16:04.880 --> 16:06.548
That's rich coming from you.

16:07.383 --> 16:10.302
Hey, wait! Where are you going, Ranmaru?

16:10.386 --> 16:14.807
You're still sulking?
It's not that I abandoned you!

16:16.308 --> 16:17.309
What's your deal?

16:17.393 --> 16:21.814
Look, there's no guarantee
that we'll be together forever.

16:23.691 --> 16:25.609
I'll be going on ahead, Ranmaru.

16:26.151 --> 16:28.070
How's your leg?

16:28.153 --> 16:32.074
You helped me on the first day
when I couldn't walk, didn't you?

16:32.157 --> 16:35.077
Did you already see me
as your enemy back then?

16:35.661 --> 16:38.706
You shouldn't strain yourself.
If possible, could you surrender instead?

16:39.415 --> 16:44.086
I don't wish to see an adorable girl
like you get hurt any further.

16:44.169 --> 16:49.341
What? You're such a gentleman, Ishikawa.
But I only have one thing to say to you…

16:49.425 --> 16:50.676
What is it?

16:50.759 --> 16:51.969
Don't look down on me.

16:53.554 --> 16:56.724
You've betrayed me
and are siding with the other team.

16:57.891 --> 17:00.728
Truly well done. You have
what it takes to become a monster!

17:00.811 --> 17:02.062
Say what you want.

17:02.146 --> 17:05.357
There's a reason
why I'm willing to abandon everything

17:05.441 --> 17:07.026
to become an official Ranger, unlike you.

17:07.109 --> 17:09.236
Everything you say just pisses me off.

17:09.319 --> 17:10.821
Your brother's incident…

17:10.904 --> 17:14.366
I'm confident that it's definitely not
the work of a boss monster.

17:14.450 --> 17:17.494
What? You insist on insulting
my older brother too?

17:17.578 --> 17:19.163
I dare you to say that again!

17:19.830 --> 17:22.082
<i>There's no way
boss monsters are still alive.</i>

17:22.166 --> 17:23.250
<i>If they are,</i>

17:23.333 --> 17:26.336
<i>then what was the point of us Dusters
living like that for the past 12 years?</i>

17:26.837 --> 17:28.130
I'll prove that they exist!

17:28.213 --> 17:30.132
I'll never admit that's true. Never!

17:34.094 --> 17:35.596
What the heck is that?

17:35.679 --> 17:37.848
<i>I'm going all-out at the start.</i>

17:37.931 --> 17:41.477
<i>You'll be sorry
that you didn't recruit me to your team.</i>

17:41.560 --> 17:44.021
<i>Our team's gonna win this!</i>

17:44.104 --> 17:45.856
<i>I have a message from Koguma.</i>

17:45.939 --> 17:48.650
He wants to share something with you,
since we're doing this as a team.

17:48.734 --> 17:49.735
Sure…

17:49.818 --> 17:51.445
He said he discovered something incredible

17:51.528 --> 17:53.280
when he took apart
the Dragon Gadget for fun.

17:53.363 --> 17:54.364
Something incredible?

17:54.448 --> 17:57.618
<i>That's right! It's not limited
to the Sword Form and Gun Form.</i>

17:57.701 --> 17:59.203
<i>He found a brand-new form…</i>

18:01.455 --> 18:03.290
<i>One that completely ignores
energy efficiency,</i>

18:03.373 --> 18:04.875
<i>and is only good for short-term combat!</i>

18:04.958 --> 18:06.919
-<i>Burst Form!</i>
-Burst Form!

18:19.556 --> 18:21.266
I'm freaking strong!

18:21.350 --> 18:24.269
Damn you! Isn't that cheating?

18:24.353 --> 18:27.272
I said that the only weapon allowed
is the Dragon Gadget, didn't I?

18:27.356 --> 18:29.525
I'm not breaking any rules here!

18:29.608 --> 18:32.528
If you want to fight
fair and square, then be my guest!

18:32.611 --> 18:36.031
I have an ambition that I have to fulfill,
no matter what I have to resort to!

18:36.824 --> 18:39.952
The outcome of a battle is determined
by how strong one's emotions are.

18:40.035 --> 18:43.288
And this overflowing energy
is the proof of that!

18:44.540 --> 18:46.333
Enough yapping!

18:51.922 --> 18:53.173
Damn it!

19:09.314 --> 19:11.608
Feel like handing over the key now?

19:13.694 --> 19:17.197
Just give it up already.
And on your brother too.

19:17.698 --> 19:19.283
I understand how frustrated you must feel

19:19.366 --> 19:22.035
to lose your older brother
to a heartless murderer.

19:22.119 --> 19:26.206
It was too much to bear that you created
an imaginary boss monster to blame on.

19:26.707 --> 19:31.628
Please think hard.
There was no boss monster, am I right?

19:31.712 --> 19:35.048
What's your deal?
You look so desperately in denial.

19:35.132 --> 19:38.635
I'm not going to waver
no matter what you say now.

19:38.719 --> 19:42.139
I've heard those same words
over and over, all these years!

19:45.350 --> 19:48.645
A boss monster?
Come on, that's impossible.

19:49.396 --> 19:52.649
Is this all for my morning schedule?
Then let's go eat!

19:52.733 --> 19:55.152
How about <i>yakiniku?</i>
One vote for <i>yakiniku!</i>

19:55.652 --> 19:57.654
No way. I saw them!

19:58.238 --> 20:00.157
Please believe me, Red Keeper!

20:00.240 --> 20:01.408
Damn.

20:01.992 --> 20:04.536
There's no record of boss monsters
coming to the surface

20:04.620 --> 20:05.913
outside of Sunday Showdowns.

20:05.996 --> 20:08.916
Your older brother was killed
by a weakass fighter.

20:09.666 --> 20:11.752
He chose the wrong career.

20:11.835 --> 20:14.504
He was never suited to be a Ranger
in the first place.

20:16.506 --> 20:19.426
The boss monsters are not my only targets.

20:19.509 --> 20:23.096
I'm going to get my revenge
on this joke of a Ranger Force.

20:23.180 --> 20:25.807
Everyone I see is my enemy!

20:27.017 --> 20:28.936
You're in my way!

20:33.607 --> 20:35.943
This is my final warning!

20:38.779 --> 20:40.697
Please hand over the key!

20:51.291 --> 20:53.210
<i>I passed the recruitment exam!</i>

20:53.293 --> 20:56.672
Congratulations, big brother!
Starting today, you're a Ranger!

20:57.256 --> 21:01.093
Thank you, Kai.
But I'm still just a cadet.

21:01.176 --> 21:03.720
I have a ways to go
before I'm assigned a color…

21:03.804 --> 21:05.722
I'll give this to you.

21:06.306 --> 21:08.809
I'm sure you can become
a Dragon Keeper, big brother!

21:08.892 --> 21:10.852
You have to exterminate the monsters!

21:10.936 --> 21:12.980
Of course! I'll do it!

21:13.063 --> 21:16.733
But you know,
I'm not just fighting against monsters.

21:16.817 --> 21:19.444
My enemies are
all the injustice in this world!

21:25.325 --> 21:30.414
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Damn it! Damn it all!

21:31.707 --> 21:35.460
Have you gone crazy? I'm over here!

21:36.628 --> 21:41.383
No way… There's no way
I'm losing in such an unfair way!

21:45.721 --> 21:47.639
Wha…

21:49.224 --> 21:51.226
Seriously? You've got to be kidding.

21:51.310 --> 21:52.894
What was it you said?

21:52.978 --> 21:54.980
"How strong one's emotions are," was it?

21:55.063 --> 21:56.231
Now we're on equal grounds.

21:57.065 --> 22:00.902
Let's begin.
The last day of the exam starts now!

23:29.908 --> 23:31.910
Translated by Qianni Lu

23:32.828 --> 23:36.248
The origins of XX's name
are finally revealed.

23:36.331 --> 23:37.457
This sounds like a proper preview!

23:37.541 --> 23:39.835
-Blue Keeper relentlessly…
-Hey, will XX make it in time?

23:39.918 --> 23:41.920
-…interrogates XX…
-Right. Hurry up, XX!

23:42.003 --> 23:44.756
Next episode! "Battle! Fever! Fighter D!"

23:44.840 --> 23:46.925
Wait, why's this about D now?
